    "description": "### **Purpose** \n\nHolds ideas and requests that are out of scope for Phase 1 per the SOW, so they aren't lost or reopened as ad-hoc Slack threads. Each ticket here is a placeholder, not a committed deliverable.\n\n### Current state\n\nTickets under this epic (WAGR-368 through WAGR-381, etc.) are one-line stubs capturing the idea and why it's out of scope — not yet scoped with acceptance criteria, effort, or a target phase.\n\n### Criteria for inclusion\n\nA ticket belongs here if it (1) was explicitly excluded from Phase 1 per SOW, and (2) needs proper discovery/scoping before it can move into an active phase.\n\n### Exit criteria\n\nA ticket leaves this epic when it's scoped (outcome, current state, proposed solution, acceptance criteria — per the WAGR-389 format) and assigned to a real phase/sprint.",
